const pageTitle = "Abstracts";
---
<Layout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
<h2>Abstracts</h2>
 <p>
	These abstract iterations were created using Adobe Photoshop for a digital imaging project during Fall 2024 that centralized around 
    gaining familiarity with various tools and techniques within the software.  I chose to explore gradients and filters 
    to extract depth and texture within the compositions. The pieces were created through layering filters, color adjustments, and 
    other effects to achieve a visually engaging abstract iterations. Each piece focuses on a particular color scheme and mood to enhance its 
    visual effect and harmonize the four quadrants within each composition.  
 </p>

  <div class="image-wrapper">
    <Image 
      src={iteration1}
